> JPW Osprey Limited specialise in all aspects of[ fa]ç[ade gl]azing, curtain walling and[ cl]adding refurbishment, operating under CDM[ often] as the principal contractor.
Having[ established] an[ excellent] reputation[ for the effective co]-[ordination and management of] suppliers[, whilst resolving] technical and[ installation issues.]
We have a long history[ of highly complex projects completed on] time and to[ budget. Projects are often carried out with the building]’[s] occupying tenants in situ, causing minimal disruption[.]
[JP]W Osprey Limited’s approach to health and safety is[ extremely] important on all projects. The[ Health] and Safety People are retained to carry out regular inspections and audit[ the business].

